      "url": "https://finance.ec.europa.eu/news/eu-agrees-fifth-package-restrictive-measures-against-russia-2022-04-08_en",
      "published_at": "2022-04-08T23:59:59Z",
      "available_at": "2022-04-08T23:59:59Z",
      "normalized_evidence": "On 8 April 2022, the European Commission described the EU's fifth package of restrictive measures as including an import ban on all forms of Russian coal and an entry ban on Russian-flagged vessels to EU ports, subject to stated exemptions.",
