      "url": "https://ustr.gov/about-us/policy-offices/press-office/press-releases/2018/august/ustr-finalizes-second-tranche",
      "published_at": "2018-08-07T23:59:59Z",
      "available_at": "2018-08-07T23:59:59Z",
      "normalized_evidence": "On 7 August 2018, USTR finalized a second Section 301 tranche covering approximately USD 16 billion of imports from China at an additional 25 percent duty, with collection beginning 23 August 2018.",
